      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "The belief that AI could become conscious rests on psychological biases and a shaky assumption — computational functionalism — that we should reject before it distorts our ethics and our self-understanding.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI"
    },
