      "title": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "We project consciousness onto AI because of baked-in psychological biases — anthropocentrism, human exceptionalism, anthropomorphism — that tie intelligence and language to experience where no connection exists.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
