      ],
      "title": "Intelligence Is Not Consciousness",
      "gist": "Intelligence is about doing and consciousness about being, so AI's achievements give no reason to think there is anything-it-is-like-to-be ChatGPT.",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
