      "title": "Consciousness & Computation",
      "gist": "Four arguments — brains are not computers, other games in town, life matters, simulation is not instantiation — undermine computational functionalism and make real artificial consciousness unlikely for familiar AI.",
      "sourceHeading": "Consciousness & Computation"
    },
