        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-yverz7"
      ],
      "title": "Do Not Create Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Deliberately creating conscious machines would be an ethical disaster, and accidental consciousness may be more likely in cerebral organoids than in LLMs.",
      "sourceHeading": "What (Not) To Do?"
    },
